      "message": "I think you should use dbus framework provided by floss.\n\nHere is an example of `on_bluetooth_audio_device_added`\n\nhttps://osscs.corp.google.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/gd/rust/linux/service/src/iface_bluetooth_media.rs\n\nhttps://osscs.corp.google.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/gd/rust/linux/stack/src/bluetooth_media.rs;l\u003d1288?q\u003don_bluetooth_audio_device_added",
